      "en": "I am weary with my groaning. Every night I flood my bed. I drench my couch with my tears.",
      "ko": "내가 탄식함으로 곤핍하여 밤마다 눈물로 내 침상을 띄우며 내 요를 적시나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "4ca031d6f2aa07653728517480165bf7847d742d9b634922809f61b75972a7c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "f3f1f7b9a42e868138dbdb0cb6e69793f79cbe2d86c9f16ec47f4f90aa9a66d6",
